The '''Institute of Physics''' ('''IOP''') is a UK-based not-for-profit [[learned society]] and [[professional body]] that works to advance [[physics education]], [[physics research|research]] and [[applied physics|application]].<ref name=iopaboutus>{{cite web |title=About us |publisher=Institute of Physics |url=http://www.iop.org/about/ |access-date=28 December 2019 |archive-date=29 December 2019 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20191229114940/http://www.iop.org/about/ |url-status=live }}</ref>

It was founded in 1874 and has a worldwide membership of over 20,000.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://d25f0oghafsja7.cloudfront.net/sites/default/files/2019-12/letter-to-the-prime-minister-13-december-2019.pdf|title=Letter to the Prime Minister|publisher=Institute of Physics|access-date=27 December 2019|archive-date=27 December 2019|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20191227072058/https://d25f0oghafsja7.cloudfront.net/sites/default/files/2019-12/letter-to-the-prime-minister-13-december-2019.pdf|url-status=dead}}</ref> The IOP is the Physical Society for the UK and Ireland and supports physics in education, research and industry.<ref name="IOP policy activity">[http://www.iop.org/policy/index.html Institute of Physics Policy Activities]</ref> In addition to this, the IOP provides services to its members including careers advice and professional development and grants the [[Professional qualifications in the United Kingdom|professional qualification]] of [[Chartered Physicist]] (CPhys), as well as [[Chartered Engineer (UK)|Chartered Engineer]] (CEng) as a nominated body of the [[Engineering Council]];<ref name="Chartered statuses offered by the IOP">{{Cite web |url=http://www.iop.org/membership/chartered/chartered_titles/page_38076.html |title=Becoming Chartered by the Institute |access-date=2010-06-30 |archive-date=2011-06-05 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20110605072324/http://www.iop.org/membership/chartered/chartered_titles/page_38076.html |url-status=live }}</ref> it also holds its own separate [[Royal Charter]]. The IOP's publishing company, [[IOP Publishing]], publishes 85 academic titles.<ref name="ioppublishing">{{cite web |url=https://ioppublishing.org/about-us/ |title=Our mission |publisher=IOP Publishing |access-date=29 December 2019 |archive-date=20 February 2020 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200220184215/https://ioppublishing.org/about-us/ |url-status=live }}</ref>

